@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p><em>Last updated: October 1, 2025</em></p>

<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, address, email, phone number, date of birth, and gender.</li>
    <li><strong>Medical Information:</strong> Patient history, consultation details, diagnoses, prescriptions, and medical notes.</li>
    <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Login credentials, account type (patient, doctor, or administrator).</li>
    <li><strong>Billing Information:</strong> Payment records, invoices, receipts, and transaction history.</li>
    <li><strong>System Data:</strong> Logs, activity records, and usage statistics for monitoring and security.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Register patients and manage appointments.</li>
    <li>Provide medical record-keeping and consultation services.</li>
    <li>Process billing and payments.</li>
    <li>Generate reports and analytics to improve clinic operations.</li>
    <li>Enhance security, prevent fraud, and ensure proper system use.</li>
    <li>Comply with applicable laws and regulations, including the Data Privacy Act of 2012 (RA 10173).</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
<p>We respect your privacy and do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data. We may share information only in the following cases:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>With authorized clinic staff:</strong> Doctors, nurses, and administrators who require access for patient care and clinic operations.</li>
    <li><strong>With third-party service providers:</strong> For secure hosting, payment processing, or analytics, under strict confidentiality agreements.</li>
    <li><strong>When required by law:</strong> To comply with legal obligations, court orders, or government requests.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Data Security</h2>
<p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to safeguard your data, in line with Republic Act No. 10173 (Data Privacy Act of 2012), including:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Authentication and authorization controls.</li>
    <li>Input validation and secure data handling.</li>
    <li>Encrypted communication and secure database storage.</li>
    <li>Logging and monitoring of system activity.</li>
</ul>
<p>While we strive to protect your information, no system is completely secure. Users are encouraged to keep their login credentials private and report any suspicious activity.</p>

<h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
<p>We retain personal and medical data only as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy, unless a longer retention period is required by law.</p>

<h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
<p>Under the Data Privacy Act of 2012 (RA 10173), you have the right to:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Access, review, and request a copy of your personal data.</li>
    <li>Request correction or updates to inaccurate information.</li>
    <li>Request deletion of your data, subject to legal or contractual obligations.</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent to data processing where applicable.</li>
    <li>File a complaint with the National Privacy Commission (NPC) if you believe your rights have been violated.</li>
</ul>
<p>For any requests, please contact us using the details provided below.</p>

<h2>7. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
<p>Our system may use cookies or similar technologies to improve functionality and user experience. You may disable cookies through your browser settings, but some features may not function properly.</p>

<h2>8. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated “Last Updated” date.</p>

<h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled, please contact us at:</p>

<p>
    <strong>LinkCare - Smart Clinic Patient Information System</strong><br />
    Davao City, Philippines<br />
    Email: linkcare@gmail.com<br />
    Phone: 09123456789
</p>

<p><strong>By using LinkCare, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to this Privacy Policy, in compliance with the Data Privacy Act of 2012 (RA 10173).</strong></p>
